@Luap99 Now I understand what's going on here: This specific page has been created around the `v6.0.0` branch and was part of another page before! But Google linked me into this page for that topic and when I wanted to check the older version I was "trapped" on the wrong page

Using the `Commands` documentation (https://docs.podman.io/en/v6.0.2/Commands.html) lets me change the versions and I can access the topics of the older version.

So you're right: No general issue, but restructuring of the documentation. Maybe some [redirects](https://docs.readthedocs.com/platform/stable/user-defined-redirects.html) may help the users.
